 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Impalement Arts icon0}}
| desc = Ringmaster throws one of his daggers to a precise point of his choosing. If he strikes an enemy, the dagger deals impact damage, briefly slows the unit hit, and causes them to bleed. The bleeding deals a percentage of the victim's maximum health in damage every second to heroes and flat damage per second to creeps.
}}
* Deals the following {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}, over {{#expr:{{#var:Impalement Arts value6}}+1}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Impalement Arts value6 tal}}+1}}|20tal}}) instances:
** For heroes: {{#var:Impalement Arts value3}} + {{calc|v1*{{#var:Impalement Arts value6}}|v1={{#var:Impalement Arts value4}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Impalement Arts value6 tal}}|v1={{#var:Impalement Arts value4}}|%}}|20tal}}) max {{M|health}} as damage.
** For creeps: {{#expr:{{#var:Impalement Arts value3}}+{{#var:Impalement Arts type1 value1}}*{{#var:Impalement Arts value6}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|{{#var:Impalement Arts value3}}+{{#var:Impalement Arts type1 value1}}*{{#var:Impalement Arts value6 tal}}}}|20tal}}) damage.

* {{cf|talnotes}} Acquiring the {{ValueColor||charges|10tal}} {{M|talent|t=t1r}} immediately grants {{ValueColor||1|10tal}} extra charge.

