{{Debuffnotes
| name = Wheel if Wonder
| desc = {{Code|wheel_mesmerize_facing}} {{M|debuff}}:<br><br>Does not apply the debuff on current [[debuff immune]] enemy units.<br>Does not affect the enemy {{M|facing angle}} accumulation timer, {{Code|wheel_mesmerize_pull}}, for current debuff immune units.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Wheel of Wonder icon0}}
| desc = Ringmaster rolls the Wheel of Wonder to the targeted location, knocking aside enemies along the way. After it reaches its target, enemies in range of the wheel take damage over time and are slowed by -50%.<br><br>Enemy heroes who face the wheel for more than 0.5 seconds are mesmerized and drawn towards it. The first enemy to be mesmerized triggers a timer for the wheel to explode. If the timer is not triggered, it will automatically explode after 4 seconds.
}}
* Deals the following amount of {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) for the entire duration:
** {{calc|v1*v2|v1={{#var:Wheel of Wonder type1 value2}}|v2={{#var:Wheel of Wonder type2 value4}}}} damage with the {{M|aura}} linger duration, over {{calc|v1/{{#var:Wheel of Wonder basic1}}|v1={{#var:Wheel of Wonder type2 value4}}}} instances.
** {{calc|v1*v2+v3|v1={{#var:Wheel of Wonder type1 value2}}|v2={{#var:Wheel of Wonder type2 value4}}|v3={{#var:Wheel of Wonder type2 value5}}}} total damage with the explosion damage.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|wheel_mesmerize_pull}}
** Applies both the {{M|stun}} and {{M|hypnotising-fear}} at the same time for affected units {{Code|≤ {{#var:Wheel of Wonder type3 value1}}-distance}} from the Wheel once they accumulate the {{#var:Wheel of Wonder type2 value1}}-second facing time.
** The debuff can be applied to affected units at different point of the {{M|hypnotising-fear|x}} duration. However, it will always ends upon the Wheel's explosion.

* The ability effects are applied as follows while traveling:
*# The {{M|knockback}}.

